  <diagram name="Page-1" id="RycqGN2n2h6IWh_-5q--">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1891" dy="1221" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam ActivityFontSize 11\nskinparam ActivityBorderThickness 1.5\n\n|#D5E8D4|Citizen|\nstart\n:Open Web / Mobile Portal;\n:Register or Authenticate;\n:Click \&quot;Report Issue\&quot;;\n:Select Hazard Category;\n:Capture &amp; Attach Photo;\n\n|#FFF2CC|System Automation Engine|\n:Extract Device GPS Coordinates;\n:Reverse Geocode Coordinates to Address;\n\n|Citizen|\n:Inspect &amp; Confirm Map Pin;\n:Enter Issue Description;\n:Select Urgency Level\\n[Low | Medium | High | Emergency];\n:Click \&quot;Submit Complaint\&quot;;\n\n|System Automation Engine|\n:Generate Alphanumeric Complaint ID;\n:Evaluate Urgency Matrix;\nnote right\n  Emergency -&gt; P1 (SLA: 24h)\n  High      -&gt; P2 (SLA: 3d)\n  Medium    -&gt; P3 (SLA: 7d)\n  Low       -&gt; P4 (SLA: 14d)\nend note\n:Set Absolute SLA Deadline Timestamp;\n:Auto-Route to Department Queue;\nfork\n    :Send SMS &amp; Email Confirmation to Citizen;\nfork again\n    if (Priority == P1_EMERGENCY?) then (yes)\n        :Dispatch Priority Alarm Notification to Officer;\n    else (no)\n        :Queue in Standard Department Intake;\n    endif\nend fork\n\n|#F8CECC|Department Officer|\n:Access Department Dashboard;\n:Inspect Priority-Sorted Queue (P1 -&gt; P4);\n:Open Incoming Ticket Dossier;\nif (Is Ticket Valid &amp; Legitimate?) then (yes)\n    if (Duplicate Report within 50m?) then (yes)\n        :Merge into Master Ticket;\n        |System Automation Engine|\n        :Subscribe Citizen to Master Ticket;\n        stop\n    else (no)\n        |Department Officer|\n        :Select Available Field Technician;\n        :Lock Expected Resolution Date (within SLA);\n        :Click \&quot;Confirm Assignment\&quot;;\n    endif\nelse (no)\n    :Enter Rejection Justification;\n    :Mark Status as \&quot;REJECTED\&quot;;\n    |System Automation Engine|\n    :Notify Citizen with Rejection Reason;\n    stop\nendif\n\n|System Automation Engine|\n:Transition Status to \&quot;ASSIGNED\&quot;;\n:Push Work Order to Technician Device;\n:Notify Citizen of Assigned Technician &amp; Target Date;\n\n|#E1D5E7|Field Worker|\n:Receive Mobile Work Order &amp; Map Coordinates;\n:Navigate to Physical Location;\n:Update Status to \&quot;IN_PROGRESS\&quot;;\n:Perform Maintenance / Repair Operation;\n:Capture Geotagged \&quot;After\&quot; Photo;\n:Input Repair Notes;\n:Click \&quot;Mark Resolved\&quot;;\n\n|System Automation Engine|\n:Transition Status to \&quot;RESOLVED\&quot;;\n:Dispatch Verification Request to Citizen;\n\n|Citizen|\n:Open Verification Alert;\n:Inspect Side-by-Side Photos (Before vs After);\n:Select Rating (1 to 5 Stars);\n:Enter Feedback Comments;\nif (Physical Issue Completely Rectified?) then (yes)\n    :Click \&quot;Confirm Resolution\&quot;;\n    |System Automation Engine|\n    :Transition Status to \&quot;CLOSED\&quot;;\n    :Update Department KPI &amp; SLA Performance Record;\n    stop\nelse (no)\n    :Click \&quot;Dispute / Reopen Complaint\&quot;;\n    :Enter Reopening Justification;\n    |System Automation Engine|\n    :Transition Status to \&quot;UNDER_REVIEW\&quot;;\n    :Flag Ticket with \&quot;ESCALATED\&quot; Badge;\n    :Alert Department Officer of Dispute;\n    |Department Officer|\n    :Audit Field Work &amp; Re-assign;\n    stop\nendif\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="lTQtLodMgJaA5E2Qq2wx-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
